          "text": "A consultant saw a flying disc in I'.Prutiente (PRUDENTE PRESIDENTE).\n(NP) - A bad \"Correlo\" (CORRELHO) from the Soroca.bana (SOROCABA) company received in the offices of Mr. Osio (OSIO) Venidramlnt (VENIDRAMLNT), owner of the establishment for commercial re-tabeleoiment (RE-TABLEMENT). The President of PrQelen~ (PRUDENTE) says it's not a new phenomenon and that it has been happening since Saturday with a flying disc (UFO) moving.",
