          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "I witnessed a UFO in the city sky.\n\nThe informant declared that he saw a strange object in the sky at approximately 6:30 am. It moved perfectly in a straight line across the sky.\n\nFor a few moments, it was visible to several people. Mr. Vendramini, a serious and credible individual, stated that he also saw the object in the morning of Saturday.\n\nSimilar objects were observed in Presidente Prudente and neighboring cities by several people. One of them described it as a bright, disk-shaped object that disappeared suddenly.\n\nThe new informant, a serious and credible person in the region, revealed that he had seen a similar object the previous day. He described it as a bright, disk-shaped object that flew at a high speed and disappeared suddenly.\n\nThis information was reported to the local press.",
